sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant App as Application
    participant Cache as Cache
    participant DB as Database

    rect rgb(220, 255, 220)
        Note over App,DB: WRITE - Bypass cache entirely
        App->>DB: INSERT audit_log
        DB-->>App: ACK
        Note over Cache: Cache NOT polluted<br/>with write-only data
    end
    
    rect rgb(255, 220, 220)
        Note over App,DB: FIRST READ - Cache miss
        App->>Cache: GET audit_log:42
        Cache-->>App: MISS
        App->>DB: SELECT
        DB-->>App: Data
        App->>Cache: SET (only NOW it caches)
        Cache-->>App: OK
    end
    
    rect rgb(220, 220, 255)
        Note over App,DB: SUBSEQUENT READS - Hit cache
        App->>Cache: GET audit_log:42
        Cache-->>App: HIT (return data)
    end
    
    rect rgb(255, 240, 220)
        Note over App,DB: KEY BENEFIT
        Note over Cache: Cache contains ONLY data<br/>that has been READ at least once<br/>= efficient memory usage
    end
